OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Symphony of the Wild
OL,6,     FMusic is thought to be a
OL,7,     Fphenomenon unique to humans. But
OL,8,     Fdoes it echo deeper into the story
OL,9,     Fof life on earth? Ben Garrod
OL,10,     Fexplores expressions of music in
OL,11,     Four early ancestors.
OL,12,G2200 Late Junction
OL,13,     FIn the week of Bonfire Night,
OL,14,     FJennifer Lucy Allan picks sonic
OL,15,     Fbangers including tracks from
OL,16,     FPolar Praxis, Vanessa Rossetto,
OL,17,     Fand Archie Shepp.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
