OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FTonight on 'Round Midnight, Soweto
OL,7,     Fshares concert highlights from
OL,8,     Finternationally renowned composer
OL,9,     FMaria Schneider, with the UMO
OL,10,     FHelsinki Jazz Orchestra, recorded
OL,11,     Fback in June.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FBach's first solo cello suite,
OL,14,     FBeethoven's 'Ghost' piano trio and
OL,15,     FMendelssohn's first piano trio
OL,16,     Ffeature in the opening concert of
OL,17,     Fthe 2026 festival.
